  "content": {
    "id": "p20-q4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "Using the common logarithm, evaluate each of the following correct to three significant figures:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt{2.05}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1.43$",
          "worked": "Using the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}\\sqrt{2.05}&=\\frac12\\log_{10}2.05\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt{2.05}&\\approx\\frac12(0.3118)\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt{2.05}&\\approx0.1559\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse, $\\sqrt{2.05}\\approx10^{0.1559}\\approx1.43$ (3 significant figures).",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt{6.15}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2.48$",
          "worked": "Using the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}\\sqrt{6.15}&=\\frac12\\log_{10}6.15\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt{6.15}&\\approx\\frac12(0.7889)\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt{6.15}&\\approx0.39445\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse, $\\sqrt{6.15}\\approx10^{0.39445}\\approx2.48$ (3 significant figures).",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt[3]{2.07}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1.27$",
          "worked": "Using the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{2.07}&=\\frac13\\log_{10}2.07\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{2.07}&\\approx\\frac13(0.3160)\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{2.07}&\\approx0.105333\\ldots\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse, $\\sqrt[3]{2.07}\\approx10^{0.105333\\ldots}\\approx1.27$ (3 significant figures).",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 47
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt[3]{5.14}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1.73$",
          "worked": "Using the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{5.14}&=\\frac13\\log_{10}5.14\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{5.14}&\\approx\\frac13(0.7110)\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{5.14}&\\approx0.2370\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse, $\\sqrt[3]{5.14}\\approx10^{0.2370}\\approx1.73$ (3 significant figures).",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt[4]{4.15}$",
