          "short": "$1.43$",
          "worked": "Using the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}\\sqrt[4]{4.15}&=\\frac14\\log_{10}4.15\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[4]{4.15}&\\approx\\frac14(0.6180)\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[4]{4.15}&\\approx0.1545\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse, $\\sqrt[4]{4.15}\\approx10^{0.1545}\\approx1.43$ (3 significant figures).",
